Silent on the product that returns:

| # | expression | AutoCAD-2022 | BricsCAD |
|---+---+---+---|
| 12-14 | =(expt 0 -1)=, =(expt -8.0 (/ 1.0 3))= | error | inf.0 / nan.0 |
| 34 | =(gcd 0 0)= | error | 0 |
| 63, 67 | =(rtos 1.0 2 -1)=, =(distof "1" 9)= | error | "1", 1.0 |
| 104, 149 | =(chr 65.5)=, =(nth 1.5 '(1 2))= | error (fixnump) | "A", 2 (truncated) |
| 111 | =(vl-string-subst nil "a" "b")= | error | "b" |
| 121 | =(vl-list->string '(300))= | error | "\U+012C" (V26), "I" (V25) |
| 152, 160, 172 | last / append / apply on =(1 . 2)= | error "liste incorrecte" | 1, (1 3), 1 |
| 180 | =(subst 1 2 3)= | error | 3 |
| 195, 196 | =(foreach x 1 x)=, =(foreach x '(1 . 2) x)= | error | 1 |
| 241, 250 | a LAMBDA value called through a variable or MAPCAR, after READ + EVAL | error "fonction incorrecte: #<SUBR -lambda->" | works (see 2.8) |
| 380 | =(vlax-curve-getEndParam erased-ename)= | error | 1.414 (answers for an ERASED entity) |
| 523, 526, 527 | itoa / gcd / logand of 2147483648 | error (the literal is a REAL on AutoCAD) | value |
| 79 | =(>= 'a nil)= | T | error |
